Greptile id: resource-lifecycle
Severity: high
Scope: packages/**, scripts/**, test/**

Do not leak streams, sessions, listeners, processes, workers, or writers the change starts. Abort and disposal must be explicit. Owned work must stop on completion, failure, and catchable cancellation; files or state must not be released while owned work can still use them.
